.account-narrow
	h1.text-3xl.font-bold.tracking-tight Reset your password
	+if('form?.sent')
		Banner(variant="success" icon="lucide:mail") If an account uses that address, the link is on its way. It works for one hour.
	Card
		form.space-y-4(method="POST" action="?/request")
			Field(label="Email" name="email" required)
				Input(type="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" required)
			Btn(type="submit" variant="primary" class="w-full") Send the link
	a.text-sm(href="/account/login") Back to sign in

<script>
	{ form } := $props()
</script>
